OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786330073
OL,3,C'I finished what Dad started' ` man
OL,4,Cbags 282 Munros in honour of late
OL,5,Cfather
OL,7,FA Scottish man said he "finished what
OL,8,FDad started" after bagging all 282 of
OL,9,FScotland's Munros.
OL,11,FPaul Choat, 40, from Longniddry, took
OL,12,Fon the challenge of climbing all of
OL,13,FScotland's tallest mountains in honour
OL,14,Fof his father, who died from motor
OL,15,Fneurone disease (MND) just 15 peaks
OL,16,Fshort of completing the challenge
OL,17,Fhimself.
OL,26,@oD@XOUpD@LO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786330073
OL,3,C'I finished what Dad started' ` man
OL,4,Cbags 282 Munros in honour of late
OL,5,Cfather
OL,7,FHis father David had reached 267 of
OL,8,FScotland's 282 peaks over 3,000ft when
OL,9,Fhis condition made it impossible to
OL,10,Fcontinue.
OL,12,F"Hill walking was my Mum and Dad's
OL,13,Fpassion," Mr Choat said.
OL,15,F"To start with, it was just kind of a
OL,16,Fcasual hobby and then as they started
OL,17,Fclimbing more, my dad got quite into
OL,18,Fthe idea of trying to see if he could
OL,19,Fdo them all.
OL,26,@tD@AOUuD@IO]wD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786330073
OL,3,C'I finished what Dad started' ` man
OL,4,Cbags 282 Munros in honour of late
OL,5,Cfather
OL,7,F"I think they always thought that
OL,8,Fthey'd have plenty of time once he'd
OL,9,Fretired to kind of get the last ones
OL,10,Fdone, and then it was not long after
OL,11,Fretirement that he was diagnosed with
OL,12,FMND, so couldn't finish the last 15
OL,13,Fthat he had left."
OL,15,FMr Choat, his three siblings, and
OL,16,Ftheir mother completed the remaining
OL,17,F15 on David Choat's behalf, finishing
OL,18,Fjust two months before he died in 2021.
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@RO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786330073
OL,3,C'I finished what Dad started' ` man
OL,4,Cbags 282 Munros in honour of late
OL,5,Cfather
OL,7,FThe property maintenance company
OL,8,Fdirector then decided to continue and
OL,9,Fcomplete all 282 himself, raising
OL,10,Fmoney for My Name'5 Doddie Foundation
OL,11,Fin his father's memory.
OL,13,FHe completed his challenge in just
OL,14,Funder five years, and the family's
OL,15,Fefforts have now raised more than
OL,16,F#117,000 for MND research.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786330073
OL,3,C'I finished what Dad started' ` man
OL,4,Cbags 282 Munros in honour of late
OL,5,Cfather
OL,7,FLooking back, Mr Choat said there were
OL,8,Fdefinitely a few moments where he was
OL,9,Fquestioning whether or not the
OL,10,Fchallenge was something he really
OL,11,Fwanted to do.
OL,13,FHe said: "There were a few days where
OL,14,Fthe weather turned out to be worse
OL,15,Fthan the forecast, and you get to a
OL,16,Fpoint where you feel a bit miserable
OL,17,Fabout being soaked through and blown
OL,18,Fthis way and that, and definitely
OL,19,Fquestioning whether it's worth
OL,20,Fcarrying on.
OL,26,@uD@JOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786330073
OL,3,C'I finished what Dad started' ` man
OL,4,Cbags 282 Munros in honour of late
OL,5,Cfather
OL,7,F"But every time I had one of those
OL,8,Fmoments, I would just stop for a
OL,9,Fcouple of minutes and have a wee think
OL,10,Fabout it, and then decide that it was
OL,11,Fbest to keep going."
OL,13,FMr Choat added: "I think having Dad in
OL,14,Fmy mind was usually what kind of kept
OL,15,Fme going when things got pretty tough."
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@TO]uD@QOUwD@gO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786330073
OL,3,C'I finished what Dad started' ` man
OL,4,Cbags 282 Munros in honour of late
OL,5,Cfather
OL,7,FHe was forced to confront his fear of
OL,8,Fheights on exposed ridges during his
OL,9,Fchallenge and endured a 13-hour
OL,10,Fexpedition through Fisherfield during
OL,11,Fa heatwave, while another fundraising
OL,12,Fchallenge saw him tackle Scotland's
OL,13,Ffour most northerly Munros in less
OL,14,Fthan 24 hours.
OL,16,FAlthough it began as something he
OL,17,Fwanted to do for his father, Mr Choat
OL,18,Fsaid it eventually became something he
OL,19,Fwanted to do for himself as well.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786330073
OL,3,C'I finished what Dad started' ` man
OL,4,Cbags 282 Munros in honour of late
OL,5,Cfather
OL,7,FHe said: "I think overcoming things
OL,8,Fthat I wouldn't have done otherwise,
OL,9,Fputting myself in situations that I
OL,10,Fwasn't comfortable with, but pushing
OL,11,Fmyself, and the benefits from that `
OL,12,Fit became more apparent the more I did
OL,13,Fthat I was getting a lot more out of
OL,14,Fit than I kind of ever thought I
OL,15,Fwould."
OL,17,FLooking back, Mr Choat said climbing
OL,18,Fall 282 of Scotland's tallest
OL,19,Fmountains was never something he ever
OL,20,Fsaw himself doing.
OL,26,@oD@JOUwD@GO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G8/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30309
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786330073
OL,3,C'I finished what Dad started' ` man
OL,4,Cbags 282 Munros in honour of late
OL,5,Cfather
OL,7,FHe said that when he was a child, he
OL,8,Fwas "dragged up" two Munros with his
OL,9,Ffather, but it was never really on his
OL,10,Fradar until after his father's
OL,11,Fdiagnosis.
OL,13,FMr Choat said: "I think I massively
OL,14,Funderestimated what was involved, but
OL,15,Fit went from being a sort of
OL,16,Ffundraising challenge in honour of Dad
OL,17,Fto this amazing journey around
OL,18,FScotland, full of lots of memories
OL,19,Fthat I won't forget, particularly when
OL,20,Fwe finished."
OL,26,@pD@EOUpD@PO]uD@POU|D@MO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G9/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30310
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786330073
OL,3,C'I finished what Dad started' ` man
OL,4,Cbags 282 Munros in honour of late
OL,5,Cfather
OL,7,FHe saved Schiehallion, near Aberfeldy,
OL,8,Ffor his final climb, hoping it would
OL,9,Fallow several generations of his
OL,10,Ffamily to be involved.
OL,12,FThe company director was joined by
OL,13,Ffamily and friends, including his six-
OL,14,Fyear-old daughter Skye, who completed
OL,15,Fher first Munro alongside him.
OL,17,FHeavy rain soaked the group during
OL,18,Flast month's climb, but Skye continued
OL,19,Fto the summit alongside Mr Choat and
OL,20,Fher mother Becca.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30311
SC,0011
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786330073
OL,3,C'I finished what Dad started' ` man
OL,4,Cbags 282 Munros in honour of late
OL,5,Cfather
OL,7,FAfter powering through what he
OL,8,Fdescribed as a tough walk, the family
OL,9,Fcracked open a bottle of champagne at
OL,10,Fthe top and hurried back down the
OL,11,Fmountain cold and wet.
OL,13,FSkye said it was "good" to see her
OL,14,Ffather complete his challenge, and
OL,15,Fsaid she enjoyed "everything" about
OL,16,Fher first Munro ` even the wind and
OL,17,Frain.
OL,19,FLooking back at his accomplishment, Mr
OL,20,FChoat said he feels a "bit of relief".
OL,26,@uD@ROUuD@WO]wD@ROUwD@]O]|D@WOU|D@eO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G11/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30312
SC,0012
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786330073
OL,3,C'I finished what Dad started' ` man
OL,4,Cbags 282 Munros in honour of late
OL,5,Cfather
OL,7,FHe added: "I doubted myself a few
OL,8,Ftimes and I almost felt a bit of a
OL,9,Fweight of wanting to do it for Dad `
OL,10,Fso there was a wee bit of pressure
OL,11,Fthat I put on myself.
OL,13,F"I think once we reached the final
OL,14,Fsummit, there was a little bit of
OL,15,Frelief, but also kind of was just
OL,16,Freally pleased for Dad and for myself.
OL,18,F"Obviously, it was kind of a full
OL,19,Fcircle moment, especially with Skye
OL,20,Fbeing there on her first Munro."
OL,26,@oD@KOUuD@AOUzD@AOU|D@`O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G12/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30313
SC,0013
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786330073
OL,3,C'I finished what Dad started' ` man
OL,4,Cbags 282 Munros in honour of late
OL,5,Cfather
OL,7,FMr Choat added: "I kind of felt like I
OL,8,Fwas able to finish what Dad started.
OL,10,F"Since then it's been quite nice to
OL,11,Fkind of just sit back in there and
OL,12,Fkind of soak it all in a wee bit."
OL,14,FSpeaking more about his mission to
OL,15,Fraise money and awareness for MND, Mr
OL,16,FChoat said he believes awareness and
OL,17,Fresearch have moved forward
OL,18,Fsignificantly since his father's
OL,19,Fdiagnosis, but is determined to
OL,20,Fcontinue fundraising.
OL,26,@oD@QOUrD@AOUtD@bO]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G13/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30314
SC,0014
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786330073
OL,3,C'I finished what Dad started' ` man
OL,4,Cbags 282 Munros in honour of late
OL,5,Cfather
OL,7,F"I feel like it's our duty to an
OL,8,Fextent because we're able to do these
OL,9,Fthings and raise a bit of money at the
OL,10,Fsame time to help those who can't," he
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,F"I think it's important to do what we
OL,14,Fcan because when Dad was diagnosed
OL,15,Fthere wasn't really any (treatment) at
OL,16,Fall ` it's a case of getting your
OL,17,Fdiagnosis, and that's that.
OL,26,@oD@AOUrD@cO]uD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G14/15
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,000,100
PN,30315
SC,0015
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F303A1786330073
OL,3,C'I finished what Dad started' ` man
OL,4,Cbags 282 Munros in honour of late
OL,5,Cfather
OL,7,F"Not much has changed since then.
OL,8,FResearch is moving forwards, but
OL,9,Fthere's not really any huge
OL,10,Fdevelopments in terms of treatments
OL,11,Fyet.
OL,13,F"It feels like we're getting closer,
OL,14,Fbut there's more to do.
OL,16,F"It just inspires us to keep going
OL,17,Freally and do what we can."
OL,26,@oD@AOUuD@AOUxD@AOUyD@[O]
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G15/15
